GCMM exFAT is a modified version of GCMM, the GameCube memory card manager
by dsbomb, justb and suloku (https://github.com/suloku/gcmm), based on
askot's libOGC Memory Card Backup. Like GCMM, it is free software under the
GNU General Public License, version 3 or later (see COPYING). You can use,
share and change it under those terms.

The parts written for GCMM exFAT that also appear in Arial-Bold's other
GameCube apps (the network, transfer and update code in source/net, the menu sounds
in source/sfxsynth.c and source/sound.c, and the program loader in
source/dolload.c) are additionally available under the MIT License from
those apps. Within GCMM exFAT they are distributed under the GPL with the
rest of the program.

Other parts:
- mbedTLS (downloaded by get-deps.sh): Apache License 2.0.
- QR Code generator library (source/net/qrcodegen.c): Project Nayuki, MIT License.
- cacert.pem: Mozilla's trusted root certificates (Mozilla Public License 2.0).
- M PLUS Rounded 1c font: SIL Open Font License (tools/fonts/OFL.txt).
- libogc2 and libdvm: Extrems and the devkitPro team, under their own licences.

